+    0  x: MULADD R2.x, R1.x, C4.x, -0.5
+       y: MULADD R2.y, R1.y, C4.y, -0.5
+    1  x: FRACT  R3.x, PV0.x
+       y: FRACT  R3.y, PV0.y
+    2  x: ADD    R2.x, R2.x, -PV1.x
+       y: ADD    R2.y, R2.y, -PV1.y
